      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wormleysburg%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The borough of Wormleysburg is home to the Harsco Corporation.",
